  title: Top secret experiment resume
  content: "\u2116:  0994\n\nRisks:\n\nHigh mortality rate\n\nMutations:\n\nThree
    times the original size of the subject, \nbloating, skin color and strength change
    (Similar to \"--------------------------------\"), and limb and head shape change.
    The subject stops understanding human speech and becomes uncontrollable. Especially
    dangerous\n\nResults\n\nThe object remains in a stable state. Easily transferred
    all stages, but began to show aggression. It is necessary to close the ego further
    from others. In no case do not approach him closer than 3 meters without protection
    or with other subjects!"
